{"id":383,"flavor":[{"games":["Alpha Sapphire"],"text":"Through Primal Reversion and with nature’s full power, it will take back its true form. It can cause magma to erupt and expand the landmass of the world."},{"games":["Omega Ruby"],"text":"Groudon is said to be the personification of the land itself. Legends tell of its many clashes against Kyogre, as each sought to gain the power of nature."},{"games":["Y","LeafGreen","FireRed"],"text":"This legendary Pokémon is said to represent the land. It went to sleep after dueling Kyogre."},{"games":["X","SoulSilver","HeartGold"],"text":"Said to have expanded the lands by evaporating water with raging heat. It battled titanically with Kyogre."},{"games":["White 2","Black 2","White","Black","Platinum","Pearl","Diamond"],"text":"It had been asleep in underground magma ever since it fiercely fought Kyogre long ago."},{"games":["Emerald"],"text":"GROUDON has appeared in mythology as the creator of the land. It sleeps in magma underground and is said to make volcanoes erupt on awakening."},{"games":["Sapphire"],"text":"GROUDON has the power to scatter rain clouds and make water evaporate with light and heat. It came as a savior to people who had been suffering from terrible floods."},{"games":["Ruby"],"text":"GROUDON has long been described in mythology as the POKéMON that raised lands and expanded continents. This POKéMON took to sleep after a cataclysmic battle with KYOGRE."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Drought","hidden":false,"description":"Turns the sunlight harsh when the Pokémon enters a battle."}],"eggGroups":["Undiscovered"],"genderRate":-1,"hatchCounter":120,"baseHappiness":0,"growthRate":"slow","habitat":"rough terrain","color":"Red","shape":"Upright","evolution":{"id":383,"name":"Groudon","condition":null,"children":[]},"moves":{"game":"Scarlet / Violet","level":[[1,184],[1,246],[1,341],[1,436],[1,619],[9,414],[18,339],[27,89],[36,359],[45,90],[54,156],[72,126],[81,76],[90,284]],"machine":[332,776,34,280,339,523,242,91,3